        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-K5520, Colonial Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Colonial Knocker is beautiful door knocker featuring a traditional urn tip design. This front door colonial knocker is 8 inches tall with 4-9/16 inch center to center mounting. Made out of solid brass, it is available in a wide array of finishes. Come packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. <a href=\"/collections/brass-accents-door-knockers\">Brass Accents Door Knockers</a> are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Brass Accents A07-K5520 Colonial Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness of Door Knocker: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
